# Duvet generated artifacts. Both are re-derived from the markdown spec on
# every `duvet report`, so committing them would duplicate the spec text and
# let it drift. The snapshot at .duvet/snapshot.txt IS committed — it is what
# `duvet report --ci` verifies against.
.duvet/reports/
.duvet/requirements/
